      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "olfactory",
        "poison"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The goblin snake belches a cloud of nauseating vapor in a 15ft Type:cone. Non-goblin creatures within the cloud must succeed at a DC 16 Fortitude Saving Throw save or become Sickened 1. On a critical failure, a creature is also Slowed 1 for as long as it is sickened. Creatures that successfully save are immune for 24 hours. The goblin snake can't use Goblin Breath again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
